/**
 * This script converts user-friendly country and language names from the form input
 * into the specific formats required by both SerpApi and DataForSEO.
 *
 * @param {Object} $input - The input data from the previous n8n node.
 * @returns {Object} A new JSON object containing the required codes for both services.
